Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我躺在退伍军人医院里的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I was lying there in the VA hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:45.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的人生中间被炸出了一个大洞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a big hole blown through the middle of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开始梦到自己在飞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I started having these dreams of flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自由了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但迟早，你总得醒来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sooner or later, though, you always have to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.45,0:01:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在冷冻休眠中，你根本不会做梦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In cryo, you don't dream at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉不像过了六年\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't feel like six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更像是一瓶龙舌兰下肚，再加上一顿暴揍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More like a fifth of tequila and an ass-kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米才是科学家，不是我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tommy was the scientist, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是他想被送上几光年外的太空\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was the one who wanted to get shot light-years out in space
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去寻找答案\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to find the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我们到了，阳光小子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we're there, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:43.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是关于你弟弟的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}汤米出发前一周\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, a week before Tommy's gonna ship out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个拿枪的家伙为了他钱包里的钞票，终结了他的旅程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a guy with a gun ends his journey for the paper in his wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在冷冻休眠中待了五年九个月零二十二天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been in cryo for five years, nine months and 22 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会感到饥饿，会很虚弱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will be hungry. You will be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:04.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果感到恶心，请使用袋子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you feel nausea, please use the sacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，汤米才是科学家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Tommy was the scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我嘛，只是又一个笨大兵，正要去一个他迟早会后悔的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me, I'm just another dumb grunt going someplace he's gonna regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前方就是潘多拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up ahead was Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们从小听着它长大，但我从没想过自己会去那儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You grew up hearing about it, but I never figured I'd be going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你弟弟代表着一笔巨额投资\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your brother represented a significant investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们想跟你谈谈，接手他的合同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'd like to talk to you about taking over his contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.21,0:02:51.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然你的基因组和他完全相同，你可以接替他的位置\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And since your genome is identical to his, you could step into his shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以这么说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会是在新世界的一个全新开始\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'd be a fresh start on a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且报酬不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the pay is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常不错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-戴上呼吸面罩！快走！戴上呼吸面罩！  -戴上呼吸面罩！快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Exo-packs on! Let's go! Exo-packs on!   -Exo-packs on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住，各位，面罩一掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember, people, you lose that mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}20秒内昏迷，四分钟内死亡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're unconscious in 20 seconds, you're dead in four minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天谁都别死！写进报告里很难看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's nobody be dead today! Looks very bad on my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}地狱之门塔台，这是TAV 1-6，正在进近\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell's Gate tower, this is TAV 1-6 on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通过外指点标。矿区已进入视野\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Crossing outer marker. Mine is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一段生命结束\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One life ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}另一段开始\N{\rEN\blur0.8}another begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解开安全带！拿好背包！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Harnesses off! Get your packs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-收拾好，出发！出发！  -解开安全带！还有一分钟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Put it together, let's go! Let's go!   -Harnesses off! One minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舱门一放下，直接进基地。不要停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When that ramp comes down, go directly into the base. Do not stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接进去。等我的信号！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go straight inside. Wait for my mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走快走！离开那儿！别停！走，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go, go, go! Get out of there! Keep moving! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:14.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有所谓的前陆战队员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no such thing as an ex-Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能退役了，但那股劲永远丢不掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may be out, but you never lose the attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:23.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉自己，别人能通过的考验，我也能通过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told myself I could pass any test a man could pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要有钱，他们能修好脊椎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They can fix a spinal, if you got the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但靠退伍福利不行，这经济形势下更不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but not on vet benefits, not in this economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:38.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，特例！别让我等你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, special case! Do not make me wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瞧瞧，女士们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这些新来的嫩肉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at all this fresh meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在地球上，这些家伙是陆军、陆战队的兵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back on Earth, these guys were Army dogs, Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为自由而战\N{\rEN\blur0.8}fighting for freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当心，飙车小子！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look out, hot rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在这儿，他们只是雇佣兵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But out here they're just hired guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿钱办事，为公司卖命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}taking the money, working for the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个，伙计\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Check this out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:13.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轮子上的美食\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Meals on wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，这太不像话了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, man, that is just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我大概二十分钟后能空出两个人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got two guys free in about 20 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了！正需要人手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it! Need them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已经不在堪萨斯了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not in Kansas anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在潘多拉，女士们先生们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are on Pandora, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一天每一秒都要牢记这一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Respect that fact every second of every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果真有地狱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If there is a hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:51.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在潘多拉服役一轮后，你可能会想去那儿放松放松\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you might want to go there for some R&R after a tour on Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面，那道围栏之外\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out there, beyond that fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一个爬的、飞的、蹲在泥里的活物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}every living thing that crawls, flies or squats in the mud
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:02.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都想杀了你，把你的眼珠当软糖吃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}wants to kill you and eat your eyes for Jujubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有一个原住民人形种族，叫纳威人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an indigenous population of humanoids called the Na'vi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们喜欢用涂了神经毒素的箭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're fond of arrows dipped in a neurotoxin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一分钟内就能让你的心脏停跳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that'll stop your heart in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的骨骼还由天然碳纤维强化过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they have bones reinforced with naturally occurring carbon fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们非常难杀死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They are very hard to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为安全主管，我的职责是让你们活着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As head of security, it is my job to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会成功\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will not succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少保不住你们所有人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果想活下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you wish to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们得培养出强大的心理素质\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you need to cultivate a strong mental attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须遵守规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got to obey the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}潘多拉的规则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pandora rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一条……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rule number one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有什么比老派的安全简报\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing like an old-school safety brief
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更能让人安心了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to put your mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:08:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下。打扰一下。杰克！你是杰克，对吧？汤姆的弟弟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Excuse me. Jake! You're Jake, right? Tom's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！你跟他长得一模一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow! You look just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，我叫诺姆·斯佩尔曼。我和他一起受过阿凡达训练\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, I'm Norm. Spellman. I went through avatar training with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……进入生物实验室\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Into the bio-lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会在这里待很久。嘿！你好吗？诺姆，阿凡达驾驶员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna spend a lot of time up here. Hey! How you doing? Norm, avatar driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好。  -嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连接……连接室就在这儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Link... Here's the link room right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里就是我们连接阿凡达的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is where we're connecting to the avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和诺姆来驾驶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me and Norm are here to drive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:27.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些远程控制的躯体，叫阿凡达\N{\rEN\blur0.8}these remotely controlled bodies called avatars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们是用人类DNA和原住民DNA混合培育出来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they're grown from human DNA mixed with the DNA of the natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿。欢迎。  -嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey. Welcome.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-欢迎来到潘多拉。很高兴你加入。  -谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Welcome to Pandora. Good to have you.   -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！它们长这么大了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn! They got big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，它们在飞行途中就完全成熟了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they fully mature on the flight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本体感觉模拟好像效果很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the proprioceptive sims seem to work really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，肌肉状态很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, they've got great muscle tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:49.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得花几个小时才能把他们从培养槽里取出来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll take us a few hours to get them decanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你们明天就能带他们出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you guys can take them out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的在那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，我是诺姆·斯佩尔曼博士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Dr. Norm Spellman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是马克斯·帕特尔博士。很高兴见到你。  -很高兴见到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dr. Max Patel. Great to meet you.   -Good to meet you, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长得像他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，长得像你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，现在这是你的阿凡达了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is your avatar now, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原理是每个驾驶员都配有自己的阿凡达，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the concept is that every driver is matched to his own avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样他们的神经系统就能同步，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that their nervous systems are in tune,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他们才找我，因为我能和汤米的阿凡达链接，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is why they offered me the gig, because I can link with Tommy's avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那东西贵得离谱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is insanely expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:57.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样对吗？我就对着视频日志随便说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this right? I just say whatever to the video log?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们得养成记录一切的习惯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we gotta get in the habit of documenting everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记录我们看到的、感受到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, what we see, what we feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:04.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这都是科学的一部分。  -好的科学就是好的观察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's all part of the science.   -And good science is good observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且这能帮你在接下来六年里保持清醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Plus it'll help to keep you sane for the next six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，随便。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我在这儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, here I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞科学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}doing science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要出来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}注意，驾驶员正退出链接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Attention. Drivers coming out of link.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实验服呢？实验服在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the lab coat? Where's the lab coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:43.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁拿了我该死的烟？伙计们！这画面哪里不对劲吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's got my goddamn cigarette? Guys! What's wrong with this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢！  -格蕾丝·奥古斯汀是个传奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you!   -Grace Augustine is a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是阿凡达计划负责人。她写了那本书，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's the head of the Avatar Program. She wrote the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:53.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，真的写了关于潘多拉植物学的书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, literally wrote the book on Pandoran botany.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是因为她喜欢植物胜过喜欢人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's 'cause she likes plants better than people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她来了，灰姑娘从舞会回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here she is, Cinderella back from the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:01.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝，给你介绍诺姆·斯佩尔曼和杰克·萨利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace, I'd like you to meet Norm Spellman and Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:07.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诺姆，我听说过你的好评。你的纳美语怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Norm. I hear good things about you. How's your Na'vi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿万物之母……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May the All Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……在我们初次相见时微笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_..smile upon our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:16.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错。就是听起来有点正式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not bad. You sound a little formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:19.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我学了五年……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! studied for five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……但还有很多要学。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_..but there is much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-格蕾丝？这位是杰克·萨利。  -长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Grace? This is Jake Sully.   -Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了行了，我知道你是谁，我不需要你。我需要你哥哥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah. I know who you are, and I don't need you. I need your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那个为这任务训练了三年的博士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the PhD who trained for three years for this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:35.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这给大家添了大麻烦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it's a big inconvenience for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你受过多少实验室训练？  -我解剖过一次青蛙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How much lab training have you had?   -I dissected a frog once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:47.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到了吧？看到了吧？他们就是往我们身上撒尿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see? You see? I mean, they're just pissing on us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连假装下雨的客气都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without even the courtesy of calling it rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我要去找塞尔弗里奇。  -别，格蕾丝，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm going to Selfridge.   -No, Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我觉得这不是好主意。  -不，伙计，这太扯淡了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't think that's a good idea.   -No, man, this is such bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去踹他那公司佬的屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna kick his corporate butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:58.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他凭什么插手我的部门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He has no business sticking his nose in my department.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天早上八点到这里。尽量用点高级词。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here tomorrow, 0800. Try and use big words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝎子二号-H，地狱门塔台。允许向南起飞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scorpion Two-Hotel, Hell's Gate tower. You are cleared for south departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:18.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}悬浮出租车，德尔塔跑道。发送识别码。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hover taxi, Delta runway. Squawk ident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你看到了吗？  -看到了，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You see that?   -Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你没看到。你刚才在看显示器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you didn't. You were looking at the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱这根推杆，罗尼！我爱这根推杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love this putter, Ronnie! I love this putter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帕克，我以前以为那只是善意的疏忽，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parker, you know, I used to think it was benign neglect,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我看出来了，你是在故意整我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but now I see that you're intentionally screwing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:44.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝，你知道，我挺享受我们的小谈话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace, you know, I enjoy our little talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要研究员，不是个半途而废的陆战队员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need a researcher. Not some jarhead dropout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我觉得我们运气不错，捡到了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, actually, I thought we got lucky with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-运气不错？  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Lucky?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这哪门子运气不错？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is this in any way lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运气好在你的人有个双胞胎兄弟，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lucky your guy had a twin brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还运气好在他不是什么口腔清洁师之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and lucky that brother wasn't some oral hygienist or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个我们能用的陆战队员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A Marine we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把他派到你的队里当安全护卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm assigning him to your team as security escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最不需要的就是又来个爱扣扳机的蠢货！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last thing I need is another trigger-happy moron out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，听着，你本该去赢得原住民的心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, look, you're supposed to be winning the hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和思想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the minds of the natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不就是你那出小木偶戏的全部意义吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that the whole point of your little puppet show?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你长得像他们、说话像他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you look like them and you talk like them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就会开始信任我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then they'll start trusting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们给他们建学校，教他们英语，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We build them a school, we teach them English,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是过了……多少年来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but after, what, how many years?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和原住民的关系只是越来越糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relations with the indigenous are only getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:27.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你拿机枪扫他们的时候，通常就会这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that tends to happen when you use machine guns on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能……我不能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't... I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就是为这个来的。超导矿石。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is why we're here. Unobtanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这种灰色小石头一公斤卖两千万。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because this little gray rock sells for 20 million a kilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是唯一的理由。整个行动都靠它买单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the only reason. It's what pays for the whole party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:46.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也靠它给你的科学买单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's what pays for your science.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:51.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在那些野蛮人在威胁我们整个行动，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, those savages are threatening our whole operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们正处在战争边缘，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're on the brink of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你应该去找个外交解决方案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're supposed to be finding a diplomatic solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以用你手上的资源，给我拿出点成果来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So use what you've got, and get me some results.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你累计了多少链接时间？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how much link time have you logged?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:16.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-大概520小时。  -不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-About 520 hours.   -That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:21.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在里面，你在这儿。你累计了多少？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're in there. You're here. How much have you logged?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}零。但我读过手册。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zip. But I read a manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在开玩笑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me you're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真酷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:37.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别动。我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你就觉得自己该来这儿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you just figured you'd come out here,
