Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为又是一个鬼地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I figured it's just another hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我自己就是第一侦察营的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was First Recon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比你早几年。嗯，可能不止几年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A few years ahead of you. Well, maybe more than a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在尼日利亚跑了三趟，一点伤都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three tours Nigeria, not a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来了这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I come out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.93,0:21:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一天。你以为我当时不像个嫩头少尉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Day one. Think I felt like a shavetail louie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:51.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。要是我轮换回国，他们能把我治好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. They could fix me up, if I rotated back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，还能把我弄得跟原来一样漂亮。可你知道吗？我还挺喜欢这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and make me pretty again. But you know what? I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.69,0:22:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它每天都提醒我，外面等着的是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It reminds me every day what's waiting out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿凡达计划就是个笑话。一帮软蛋理科生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Avatar Program is a bad joke. Bunch of limp-dick science majors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，它确实带来了一个又及时又难得的机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}However, it does present an opportunity both timely and unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-无异常！  -无异常！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Clear!   -Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个侦察兵，装在阿凡达身体里。这组合够劲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A recon gyrene in an avatar body. That's a potent mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都起鸡皮疙瘩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me the goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样的陆战队员能给我提供我需要的情报，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Such a Marine could provide the intel I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在地面上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}right on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:37.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直接进敌人的营地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right in the hostiles' camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:43.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，萨利。我要你从内部了解这些野蛮人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Sully. I want you to learn these savages from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.99,0:22:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你赢得他们的信任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to gain their trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得知道怎么逼他们合作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to know how to force their cooperation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者他们不配合，就狠狠揍他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or hammer them hard if they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我还归奥古斯丁管吗？  -名义上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Am I still with Augustine?   -On paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:58.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，你走路像她那帮书呆子，说话也像，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you walk like one of her science pukes, you quack like one,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.59,0:23:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你向我汇报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but you report to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能为我做到吗，孩子？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you do that for me, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, yeah, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子，我会照顾自己人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Son, I take care of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我我需要的东西，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get me what I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证你轮换回国时能重新长出双腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see to it you get your legs back when you rotate home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真正的腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your real legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.50,0:23:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那太好了，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds real good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:45.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-连接准备好了！  -相位锁定40%。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Link's ready!   -Phase-lock 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只管闭嘴，让诺姆来说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just keep your mouth shut and let Norm do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}五项一致。相位锁定90%。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have five congruencies. Phase-lock 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.39,0:23:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三号连接就绪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Link three ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.39,0:23:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我进去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关掉它。我们要待一会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut it down. We're gonna stay a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-诺姆！你的背包。  -背包。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Norm! Your pack.   -Pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.31,0:25:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}留在飞船这儿。有一个拿枪的傻瓜就够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay with the ship. One idiot with a gun is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.77,0:25:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你厉害，博士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You the man, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.98,0:26:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原猴。它们没有攻击性。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prolemuris. They're not aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.69,0:26:12.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松，陆战队员。你搞得我紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Relax, Marine. You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:20.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他们怎么知道我们在这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how will they know we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.41,0:26:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我敢说他们现在就在看着我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure they're watching us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-继续走，诺姆。  -大家跟上！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep moving, Norm.   -Keep up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那我开始了。  -扫描中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And here I go.   -Scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！这么快？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow! It's that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-很神奇吧？  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Amazing, isn't it?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.52,0:26:47.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，信号是从这条根传导\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that is signal transduction from this root
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到旁边那棵树的根。所以我们应该取个样本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to the root of the tree next to it. So, we should take a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.11,0:26:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。样本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.74,0:26:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}按反应速度来看，这大概是电信号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's probably electrical, based on the speed of the reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:03.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}诺姆，你的口水把样本污染了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Norm, you've contaminated the sample with your saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.05,0:28:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别开枪。别开枪，你会惹毛他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't shoot. Don't shoot, you'll piss him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.64,0:28:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他已经毛了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's already pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，那层甲太厚了。相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake, that armor's too thick. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.20,0:28:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是领地的威胁展示。别跑，不然他会冲过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a territorial threat display. Do not run, or he'll charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.95,0:28:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我怎么办，跟它跳舞？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what do I do, dance with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就站住别动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hold your ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.35,0:28:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？来啊！你有什么本事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Come on! What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.85,0:28:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦耶。谁厉害？这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. Who's bad? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.81,0:28:53.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是这个，贱货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's what I'm talking about, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.78,0:28:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错，滚回你妈那儿去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right, get your punk ass back to mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:29:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？你什么都没有。你继续跑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Yeah, you got nothing. You keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.45,0:29:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你怎么不带几个朋友回来，啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and why don't you bring back some of your friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.54,0:29:07.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.51,0:29:21.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这个呢？跑？不跑？怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So what about this one? Run? Don't run? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.39,0:29:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑！绝对要跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run! Definitely run!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.91,0:33:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位，我得收工了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna have to call it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.28,0:33:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不许夜间行动。上校的命令。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not allowed to run night ops. Colonel's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.91,0:33:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，博士，他只能撑到早上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Doc, he's just gonna have to hang on till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.25,0:33:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他撑不到早上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He won't make it till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.78,0:35:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可没他妈一整晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have all goddamn night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.57,0:35:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.65,0:36:36.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，等等。别！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, wait. Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.78,0:36:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.38,0:37:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我知道你可能听不懂这个，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I know you probably don't understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.02,0:37:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.36,0:37:55.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.78,0:38:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才真厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.03,0:38:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是你没来，我就完蛋了。真是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would have been screwed if you hadn't come along. It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，等一下。嘿，你去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, wait a second. Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.63,0:38:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.84,0:38:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就……嘿，慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... Hey, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，等等，我只是想谢谢你杀了那些东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, wait up, I just wanted to say thanks for killing those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:25.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-该死！  -不用谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Damn!   -Don't thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.80,0:38:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不用谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't thank for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:34.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这很悲哀。非常悲哀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is sad. Very sad only.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.60,0:38:37.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。好。对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Okay. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.57,0:38:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管我做了什么，我道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever I did, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.86,0:38:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这都是你的错。它们本来不该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All this is your fault. They did not need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.91,0:38:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的错？它们攻击我。我怎么成了坏人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My fault? They attacked me. How am I the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.04,0:38:51.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的错！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的错！  -好了。好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your fault!   -Easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.96,0:38:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就像个婴儿。只会嚷嚷，不知道该怎么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're like a baby. Making noise, don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:00.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别激动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.46,0:39:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是真爱你的森林小伙伴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you love your little forest friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.76,0:39:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干嘛不干脆让它们杀了我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why not let them just kill my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.60,0:39:14.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么道理？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.14,0:39:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什么救你？  -对，对，为什么救我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why save you?   -Yeah. Yeah, why save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.28,0:39:24.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有一颗坚强的心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a strong heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.36,0:39:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无所畏惧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但很蠢！像孩子一样无知。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But stupid! Ignorant like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.38,0:39:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，如果我像个孩子，那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, if I'm like a child, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，也许你该教教我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, maybe you should teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.76,0:39:49.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天空人学不会。你们看不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sky People cannot learn. You do not See.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就教我怎么看见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then teach me how to See.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.97,0:39:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没人能教你怎么看见。  -哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No one can teach you to See.   -Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.81,0:39:57.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，别这样，我们不能聊聊吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, come on, can't we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.23,0:40:02.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了，你英语在哪儿学的？奥古斯丁博士的学校？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Say, where'd you learn to speak English? Dr. Augustine's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.95,0:40:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就像个婴儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.83,0:40:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你的帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.50,0:40:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不该来这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should not be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.34,0:40:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好，带上我。  -不行！回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, take me with you.   -No! Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.84,0:40:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.05,0:41:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.06,0:41:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.90,0:41:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圣树的种子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seeds of the Sacred Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.90,0:41:26.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常纯洁的灵魂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very pure spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.68,0:41:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才那是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.76,0:41:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:41:58.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.60,0:42:02.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要去哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.49,0:42:13.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.24,0:42:20.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么名字？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.04,0:42:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.65,0:42:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静，大家冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm people, calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:01.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么，苏泰？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing, Tsu'tey?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.29,0:43:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些恶魔禁止来到这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These demons are forbidden here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出现了征兆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There has been a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.34,0:43:12.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这事该由沙希克定夺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a matter for the Tsahik.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.51,0:43:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带他上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.10,0:43:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.02,0:43:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.11,0:43:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.61,0:43:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.72,0:44:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}父亲……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.89,0:44:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……见到您。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...) see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.44,0:44:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个生物……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.11,0:45:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么把他带到这里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...why do you bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.66,0:45:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来要杀了他……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was going to kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.37,0:45:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但艾娃降下了征兆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_..but there Was a sign from Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.37,0:45:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have said...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.46,0:45:11.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝不许梦行者来到这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}---NO dreamwalker will come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.71,0:45:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.59,0:45:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他身上异族的气味冲鼻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His alien smell fills my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.13,0:45:17.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，他在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.22,0:45:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲正在决定要不要杀你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father is deciding whether to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.47,0:45:24.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你父亲。很高兴见到您，先生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your father. It's nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.06,0:45:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.65,0:45:34.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我看看这个异族人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}twill look at this alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.94,0:45:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是母亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.57,0:45:40.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是沙希克，解读艾娃意志的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is Tsahik. The one who interprets the will of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾娃是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's Eywa?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.62,0:45:51.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you called?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克·萨利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.59,0:46:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你为什么来找我们？  -我来学习。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why did you come to us?   -I came to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:10.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们试过教别的天空人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have tried to teach other Sky People.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.81,0:46:14.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装满的杯子很难再装东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is hard to fill a cup which is already full.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.65,0:46:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的杯子是空的，相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, my cup is empty, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.19,0:46:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问问奥古斯丁博士就知道，我不是科学家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just ask Dr. Augustine. I'm no scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.95,0:46:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是什么人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.66,0:46:28.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾是个陆战队员。一个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was a Marine. A...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.74,0:46:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}锅盖头部落的战士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A warrior of the Jarhead clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个战士！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.17,0:46:35.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能轻易杀了他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}） could kill him easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.63,0:46:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能轻易杀了他！不行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}） could kill him easily! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.38,0:46:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们见过的第一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the first warrior dreamwalker...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.63,0:46:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}战士梦行者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-- WE have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.59,0:46:46.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得多了解他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need to learn more about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.89,0:46:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的女儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My Daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.81,0:46:55.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要教他我们的方式……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}---YOu will teach him our way...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.23,0:46:58.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}教他像我们一样说话、走路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tO speak and walk as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.73,0:47:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么是我？这不公平……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why me? That's not fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.15,0:47:07.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经决定了。我女儿会教你我们的方式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is decided. My daughter will teach you our ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.37,0:47:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好学，杰克萨利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Learn well, Jakesully.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.75,0:47:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后看看你的疯病能不能治好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then we will see if your insanity can be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.27,0:47:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.77,0:47:40.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请别起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.44,0:47:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.07,0:47:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.33,0:47:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.75,0:48:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克。杰克！  -他在阿尔法状态。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jake. Jake!   -He's in alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.12,0:48:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他马上要出来了。  -杰克。杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's coming out right now.   -Jake. Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.00,0:48:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回来吧，小子。来吧。就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on back, kid. Come on. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.72,0:48:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。好了，好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go. There you go, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.47,0:48:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事。你没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:55.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见鬼！你抓得跟蜱虫一样紧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn! You were dug in like a tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.94,0:49:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-阿凡达没事吧？  -没事，博士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-ls the avatar safe?   -Yeah, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.61,0:49:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你绝对猜不到我在哪儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you are not gonna believe where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.36,0:49:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们最后看到的，是这个陆战队员的屁股\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The last thing we see is this Marine's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.40,0:49:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}消失在灌木丛里，后面追着一只发怒的闪雷兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}disappearing into the brush with this angry thanator coming after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.53,0:49:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿，这种东西是教不来的。  -太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, it's not something you can teach.   -That is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.62,0:49:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我实在想不通为什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, for reasons I cannot fathom,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.04,0:49:22.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奥马提卡亚族竟然选了你。愿上帝保佑我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the Omaticaya have chosen you. God help us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“陆战队部落”？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Jarhead clan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.76,0:49:29.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-还真成了？  -嘿，我差不多算他们家的人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And it worked?   -Hey, I'm practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.88,0:49:34.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要研究我。我得学会成为他们的一员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna study me. I have to learn to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.39,0:49:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就叫主动出击，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's called taking the initiative, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.06,0:49:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我真希望有十个像你这样的兵。  -听着，苏利。苏利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I wish I had 10 more like you.   -Look, Sully. Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.68,0:49:42.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要弄清楚那些蓝猴子想要什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just find out what the blue monkeys want.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.86,0:49:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们试着给他们医药、教育、道路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I mean, we try to give them medicine, education, roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.74,0:49:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可不行，不行，不行，他们就是喜欢泥巴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But no, no, no, they like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.61,0:49:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这本来也不让我烦，只是他们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that wouldn't bother me, it's just that they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.16,0:49:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，能不能……谁去把……12区。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, can you... Can somebody just... Sector 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.00,0:50:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，走，走，走，停。停……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, go, go, go, stop. Stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.25,0:50:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里奇，停下！那是……老天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rich, stop! That's... Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.42,0:50:11.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们那该死的村子偏偏就坐落在这片最富的 unobtanium 矿床之上，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their damn village happens to be resting on the richest unobtanium deposit
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.59,0:50:16.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}方圆两百公里内最富的。我是说，看看那满地的钞票！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}within 200 klicks in any direction. I mean, look at all that cheddar!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.73,0:50:23.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那谁去让他们搬走？  -你猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, who gets them to move?   -Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.15,0:50:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要是他们不肯走呢？  -我赌他们会走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What if they won't go?   -I'm betting that they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.19,0:50:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，好了，好了，好了，嘿。看。看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay, okay, okay, hey. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.74,0:50:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杀原住民很难看，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Killing the indigenous looks bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.66,0:50:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但有一件事比负面新闻更让股东讨厌，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but there's one thing that shareholders hate more than bad press,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.50,0:50:42.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是难看的季度财报。规矩不是我定的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's a bad quarterly statement. I didn't make up the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:45.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以给我找根胡萝卜，让他们愿意搬，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So just find me a carrot that'll get them to move,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.71,0:50:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然就只能全用大棒了。明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}otherwise it's gonna have to be all stick. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.38,0:50:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有三个月。到时候推土机就开到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got three months. That's when the 'dozers get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.18,0:50:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在浪费时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.14,0:50:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢这家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.47,0:51:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-伙计们，就现在……  -好，我们再来一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Guys, right now...   -Okay, let's run through them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.98,0:51:04.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莫阿特。那个母夜叉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mo'at. Dragon lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.31,0:51:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-埃图坎。  -埃图坎。他是族长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Eytucan.   -Eytukan. He's the clan leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.36,0:51:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她是精神领袖。像萨满。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But she's the spiritual leader. Like a shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.61,0:51:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.28,0:51:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-苏泰。  -苏泰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-T'su'tey.   -Tsu'tey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.57,0:51:19.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-苏泰。  -他会是下一任族长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tsu'tey.   -He'll be the next clan leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.33,0:51:23.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-奈蒂莉。  -她会成为下一任萨希克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Neytiri.   -She'll be the next Tsahik.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.87,0:51:25.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会结为伴侣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They become a mated pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.88,0:51:29.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那这个艾娃是谁？  -艾娃是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So who's this Eywa?   -Who's Eywa?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.13,0:51:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他们的神。他们的女神，由所有生灵组成。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only their deity. Their goddess, made up of all living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.80,0:51:35.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们认知的一切！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything they know!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是受过一点训练就会知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'd know this if you had any training whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.43,0:51:38.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁跟族长的女儿有约啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's got a date with the chief's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.85,0:51:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-得了吧。那……  -好了，你们俩别闹了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on. That's...   -All right, knock it off, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.64,0:51:43.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。村子里的生活开始得早。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go. Village life starts early.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.35,0:51:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别做什么特别蠢的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't do anything unusually stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.87,0:52:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松，小子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.83,0:52:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帕丽是母的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pale is female.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.88,0:52:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。乖，姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Easy, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是萨黑鲁。联结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is tsaheylu. The bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:52.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感受她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.42,0:52:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感受她的心跳。她的呼吸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel her heartbeat. Her breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.51,0:53:04.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感受她有力的腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel her strong legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.77,0:53:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以告诉她该怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may tell her what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.19,0:53:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在心里说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.36,0:53:14.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，说出要去哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For now, say where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.28,0:53:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前进！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:39.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你该走了。  -不，你会想我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You should go away.   -No, you'd miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.68,0:53:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就知道你会说英语。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I Knew you could speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.47,0:53:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个外星人什么也学不会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This alien will learn nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连石头都看得比他多……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}re! rock sees more...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.06,0:53:51.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.32,0:54:02.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.45,0:54:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想打中这玩意儿，可不容易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to hit this thing, it's gonna be complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.99,0:54:08.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的扫描图没显示内部结构。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your scan doesn't show the internal structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.54,0:54:10.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外围有一排柱子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's an outer row of columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.66,0:54:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常粗壮。这里有一圈次级环，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Real heavy duty. There's a secondary ring here,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:17.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一圈内环。核心结构像个螺旋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and an inner ring. There's a core structure like a spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.00,0:54:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就是靠这个上下移动的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's how they move up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.72,0:54:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要每根柱子的精确扫描图。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna need accurate scans on every column.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.68,0:54:24.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.09,0:54:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于这个结构你还能告诉我们什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What else can you tell us about the structure?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.85,0:54:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜这圈次级环也承重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm guessing this secondary ring, that's also load-bearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.19,0:54:37.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那我们去哪？  -离开这是非之地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So where are we going?   -Getting out of Dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.03,0:54:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不会让塞尔弗里奇和夸里奇对这事指手画脚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not about to let Selfridge and Quaritch micro-manage this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.28,0:54:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}26号站点有移动链接舱，我们可以在那儿工作，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a mobile link up at Site 26 we can work out of,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.62,0:54:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在深山里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}way up in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:51.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈利路亚山？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Hallelujah Mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.70,0:54:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没错。  -你认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's right.   -Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.08,0:54:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的。  -太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -Yes|!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}潘多拉传说中的悬浮山。听说过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The legendary floating mountains of Pandora. Heard of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:18.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们快到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.65,0:55:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，看看我的仪表。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, look at my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.40,0:55:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。我们进入磁通涡流了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep. We're in the Flux Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从现在起只能目视飞行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're VFR from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.74,0:55:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么是目视飞行？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's VFR?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.74,0:55:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}意思是你得看得见路。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Means you gotta see where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.16,0:55:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你什么都看不见。  -没错。这不操蛋吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You can't see anything.   -Exactly. Ain't that a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.60,0:55:56.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.24,0:56:08.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们该看看自己的表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should see your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.81,0:56:38.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢乘坐潘多拉航空。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for flying Air Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.75,0:56:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到营地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.17,0:57:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这就是我的铺位。  -这玩意儿真恶心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So, this is my bunk.   -This stuff is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.18,0:57:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-诺姆，你睡下面。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Norm, go under.   -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.26,0:57:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-格蕾丝什么都没漏看。  -楚迪，你睡上面那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Grace didn't miss a thing.   -Trudy, you'll take the top one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.85,0:57:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她知道我在跟上校说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She knew I was talking to the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.35,0:57:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我有她需要的东西，重新进入部落的门路，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I had what she needed, a way back in with the clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.02,0:57:21.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以她才装好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so she's playing nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.73,0:57:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。杰克，往左拐。你在最里面那台链接舱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Jake, hang a left. You'll be in the link at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.70,0:57:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一号舱。比尤拉。她毛病最少。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unit one. Beulah. She's the least glitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.00,0:58:24.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.25,0:58:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别直视她的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not look in her eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.68,0:58:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊卡兰不是马。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}[kran is not horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.56,0:58:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦结成联结，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once tsaheylu is made,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.27,0:58:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊卡兰一生只跟一个猎人一起飞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ikran will fly with only one hunter in the whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.54,0:59:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要成为塔若纽，猎人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To become taronyu, hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.37,0:59:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须选择你自己的伊卡兰，而它也必须选择你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you must choose your own ikran and he must choose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.50,0:59:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么时候？  -等你准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-When?   -When you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.93,1:00:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，这是第12篇视频日志。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. This is video log 12.
