Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.56,1:00:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-诺姆最近态度好多了。  -我看见你。我看见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Norm''s attitude has improved lately.   -I see you. I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.73,1:00:55.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不只是“我看见眼前的你”，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's not just, "I'm seeing you in front of me,"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.24,1:00:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是“我看进你心里。我看见你。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's "I see into you. I See you."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.94,1:00:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他回来帮忙是好事，但他也觉得我是个白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's good he's back on board, but he thinks I'm a skxawng, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.70,1:01:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我接纳你。我理解你。”这你得掌握，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I'm accepting you. I understand you." So you gotta get this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.28,1:01:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得跑了！好吗？走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta run! Okay? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.04,1:01:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的脚越来越结实了，每天能跑得更远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My feet are getting tougher. I can run farther every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.50,1:01:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得相信身体知道该怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to trust my body to know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.76,1:01:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！看这个！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.26,1:01:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟糕！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.81,1:01:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每天都得辨认路径、水洼边的足迹，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every day it's reading the trails, the tracks at the waterhole,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.77,1:01:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最细微的气味和声音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the tiniest scents and sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.53,1:01:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她总在讲能量的流动、动物的灵魂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's always going on about the flow of energy, the spirits of animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.12,1:01:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真希望考试不考这些抱树派的鬼话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really hope this tree-hugger crap isn't on the final.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.87,1:01:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那边可不只是手眼协调，你知道的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't just about eye-hand coordination out there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.63,1:01:55.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得听她说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to listen to what she says.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.38,1:01:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}试着用她的眼睛看森林。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try to see the forest through her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.63,1:02:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，这是我的视频日志。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. This is my video log here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.61,1:02:19.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟着奈蒂莉，要么学得快，要么死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With Neytiri, it's learn fast or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.49,1:02:22.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在开玩笑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.68,1:02:54.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说服了莫阿特让格蕾丝进村子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I talked Mo'at into letting Grace into the village.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你长多大了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look how big you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.10,1:02:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是她学校被关闭后第一次来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the first time since her school was closed down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.52,1:02:59.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.94,1:03:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，你别跑。回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you don't. Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.57,1:03:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好享用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bon appétit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.23,1:03:35.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，陆战队员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.09,1:04:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想弄明白这种深厚的联系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying to understand this deep connection
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.84,1:04:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}族人和森林之间的联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the people have to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.55,1:04:09.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说到一个能量网络，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She talks about a network of energy
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.18,1:04:12.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它流经所有生物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that flows through all living things.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.64,1:04:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说所有能量都只是借来的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She says all energy is only borrowed,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.90,1:04:20.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有一天你得还回去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and one day you have to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.38,1:04:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I see you...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……兄弟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...Brother
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.22,1:04:48.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.56,1:04:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的灵魂与艾娃同在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your spirit goes with Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.02,1:04:56.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的身体留在这里……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your body stays behind...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.10,1:04:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……成为族人的一部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...to become part of The People.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.52,1:05:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干净利落的一击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A clean kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.47,1:05:38.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}学骑伊卡兰——我们叫它们女妖翼兽，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Learning to ride an ikran, we call them banshees,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.94,1:05:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是每个年轻猎人必须通过的考验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is the test every young hunter has to pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.73,1:05:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但要通过，你得去女妖翼兽的地盘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But to do that, you gotta go where the banshees are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.90,1:05:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呜啦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oo-rah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.60,1:06:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.86,1:07:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克萨利先来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jakesully will go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.69,1:08:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你选你的伊卡兰，得用心去感受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now you choose your lkran. This you must feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.61,1:08:34.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果它也选了你，就照我教你的快速动手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If he also chooses you, move quick like I showed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.65,1:08:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只有一次机会，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will have one chance, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.53,1:08:39.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么知道它选了我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How will I know if he chooses me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.78,1:08:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会试图杀了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He will try to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.91,1:08:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.60,1:09:46.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来跳舞吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.10,1:09:53.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那白痴会死的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That moron's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.88,1:10:19.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别怕，战士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be afraid, warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.76,1:10:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}建立联结！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make the bond!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.64,1:10:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.64,1:10:30.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.82,1:10:46.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}联结，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsaheylu, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.79,1:10:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}联结！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsaheylu!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:01.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.89,1:11:15.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是这样。你是我的了。嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's right. You're mine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.20,1:11:31.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首飞才能定下联结，不能等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First flight seals the bond. You cannot wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.66,1:11:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想着“飞！” -飞？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Think, "Fly!"   -Fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.47,1:11:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.14,1:11:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.86,1:12:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闭嘴，飞直了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut up and fly straight!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.29,1:12:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样。左倾！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. Bank left!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.92,1:12:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉平！就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Level out! That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.22,1:12:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克萨利！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jakesully!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.33,1:12:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.19,1:13:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好样的，这我行！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, baby, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.94,1:13:22.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.49,1:13:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我骑马可能不行，但我天生就是干这个的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I may not be much of a horse guy, but I was born to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.07,1:13:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.16,1:13:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我这样过来，这是你。  -对，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I came like this. This you.   -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.33,1:13:42.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我转弯，我感到风，我转得很猛。  -看，对，你瞧，我倾得那么狠……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I turn. I feel the wind. I turn very strong.   -Look, yeah, see, I banked so hard...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}灵魂之树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Tree of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.78,1:14:51.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他们最神圣的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's their most sacred place.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.74,1:14:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到这些假彩色图像里的通量涡流了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See the Flux Vortex in these false color images?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.66,1:14:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是它干扰了我的仪器。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's what messes up my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.83,1:15:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里的生物活动很有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is something really interesting going on in there biologically.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.75,1:15:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我死也要弄到样本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would die to get samples.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.42,1:15:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外人严禁进入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Outsiders are strictly forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.34,1:15:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这幸运的混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You lucky swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.01,1:15:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是个冷酷的空中猎手。从天而降的死神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was a Stone-cold aerial hunter. Death from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.10,1:15:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一的问题是，不止你一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only problem is, you're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.98,1:15:31.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}俯冲！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dive!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.84,1:15:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.23,1:16:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.02,1:16:53.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的人叫它“大灵鹫”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our guys call ita Great Leonopteryx.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.48,1:16:57.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是托鲁克。“最后的影子”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is Toruk. Last Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.28,1:17:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你见到的最后一个东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, right. It's the last one you ever see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.04,1:17:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爷爷的爷爷是托鲁克·马克托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My grandfather's grandfather was Toruk Macto.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.46,1:17:13.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“最后的影子”的骑手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rider of Last Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.63,1:17:16.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他骑过这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He rode this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.72,1:17:19.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是托鲁克选择了他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Toruk chose him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.72,1:17:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从“第一首歌”时代到现在，只发生过五次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It has only happened five times since the time of the First Songs.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.64,1:17:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那可真够久的。  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's a long time.   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.35,1:17:28.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}托鲁克·马克托很强大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Toruk Macto was mighty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.06,1:17:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在大悲痛时期把各部落团结在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He brought the clans together in a time of great sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.90,1:17:36.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有纳威人都知道这个故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All Na'vi people know the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.95,1:17:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在一切都颠倒了。好像外面才是真实世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything is backwards now. Like out there is the true world
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.29,1:17:50.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这里才是梦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and in here is the dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.90,1:18:13.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真难相信才过了三个月。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hard to believe it's only been three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.65,1:18:19.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我几乎记不起以前的生活了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can barely remember my old life.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.62,1:18:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道自己是谁了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.26,1:18:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没在树林里迷路吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Haven't gotten lost in the woods, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.27,1:18:52.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上次汇报是两个多星期前了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your last report was more than two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.40,1:18:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开始怀疑你的决心了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm starting to doubt your resolve!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:02.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看，是时候终止任务了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way I see it, it's time to terminate the mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我能做到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.99,1:19:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已经做到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.58,1:19:08.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我提供了好用、可用的情报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You give me good, usable intel.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.87,1:19:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个“灵魂之树”的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This Tree of Souls place.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.50,1:19:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，等事情变成一场烂仗，我就能靠它捏住他们的命根子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I got them by the balls with that when this turns into a shit fight,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.00,1:19:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定会变成烂仗。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which it will. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.67,1:19:19.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在该回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now it's time to come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.17,1:19:23.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.55,1:19:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能重新拥有自己的腿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you gonna get your legs back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.43,1:19:30.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。公司已经批准了。这事定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I got your corporate approval. It's a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.10,1:19:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚就送你上穿梭机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gonna have you on a shuttle tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.64,1:19:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说话算数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.36,1:19:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得把这事做完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.36,1:19:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.65,1:19:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}仪式。这是成为男人的最后一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ceremony. It's the final stage of becoming a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.12,1:19:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完成了，就是他们的一员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I do it, I'm one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.71,1:19:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就会信任我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they'll trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.17,1:20:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就能谈他们的搬迁条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I can negotiate the terms of their relocation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.98,1:20:19.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你最好把它办成，下士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then, you'd better get it done, Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纳威人说，每个人都会出生两次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Na'vi say that every person is born twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.92,1:20:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二次是你在族人中赢得永久位置的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The second time is when you earn your place among The People forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.60,1:20:58.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在是奥马提卡亚之子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are now a son of the Omaticaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.31,1:21:02.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是族人的一员了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are part of The People.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.90,1:21:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来。来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come. Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.51,1:22:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是祈祷被听见的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a place for prayers to be heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.84,1:22:14.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时也会得到回应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And sometimes answered.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.60,1:22:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们把这些树叫作“乌特瑞亚·莫克里”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We call these trees Utraya Mokri.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.32,1:22:28.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}声音之树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Tree of Voices.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.07,1:22:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们祖先的声音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The voices of our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.21,1:22:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能听见他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.76,1:22:55.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们活着，杰克，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They live, Jake,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.43,1:22:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在艾娃之中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}within Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.02,1:23:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在是奥马提卡亚的人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are Omaticaya now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.61,1:23:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以用家园树的木头做你的弓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You may make your bow from the wood of Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.32,1:23:16.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也可以选一个女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you may choose a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.58,1:23:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有很多好女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have many fine women.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.75,1:23:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妮娜特是最会唱歌的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ninat is the best singer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.58,1:23:28.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我不想要妮娜特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't want Ninat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.80,1:23:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}佩瑞尔是个好猎手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Peyral is a good hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.43,1:23:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，她是个好猎手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she is a good hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.60,1:23:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经选好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've already chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.90,1:23:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这个女人也必须选择我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this woman must also choose me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她已经选了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She already has.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在和你在一起了，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am with you now, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.10,1:24:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们结为终身伴侣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are mated for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.32,1:24:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在干什么，杰克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing, Jake?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.81,1:25:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.02,1:25:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别忘了相位整合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't forget your phase integration.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.36,1:25:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克！  -不，不，是中间那个按钮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jake!   -No, no, the middle button.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.82,1:25:14.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你得吃点东西。  -好，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You gotta eat something.   -Yeah, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.16,1:25:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！杰克，醒醒！杰克，求你了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake! Jake. Wake up! Jake, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.75,1:25:31.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别逼我给一个残疾人强行喂饭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't make me force-feed a cripple.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.38,1:25:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝，我不想……喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace, I don't want... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.80,1:25:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.85,1:25:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.03,1:26:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。我弄完了。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. I'm done. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.12,1:26:04.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上次洗澡是什么时候？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when was the last time you took a shower?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.45,1:26:06.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不需要洗澡。  -天哪，陆战队员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't need a shower.   -Jesus, Marine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.67,1:26:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.72,1:26:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！醒醒！杰克！醒醒！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake! Wake up! Jake! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.14,1:26:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.18,1:26:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.69,1:26:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克！  -回去，停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jake!   -Go back, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.69,1:26:40.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，头儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.49,1:26:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.28,1:26:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -我这儿有个土著\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -I got a native
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.45,1:26:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这儿跳怪舞。他挡着我的推土铲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}doing the funky chicken here. He's blocking my blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.45,1:26:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就继续开。他会让开的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, keep going. He'll move.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.66,1:26:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人得明白，我们不会停。快点，走，走，走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These people have to learn that we don't stop. Come on, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.30,1:26:59.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！喂！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.59,1:27:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走！走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.88,1:27:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？他让开了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There, see? He moved.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.69,1:27:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，老兄。哇，老兄！老兄，别！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, dude. Whoa, dude! Dude, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.32,1:27:20.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我瞎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.50,1:27:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克！  -奈蒂莉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jake!   -Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.33,1:27:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.94,1:28:05.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}画面定格在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Freeze it right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.07,1:28:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放大。增强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scale up. Enhance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.20,1:28:12.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}狗娘养的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.21,1:28:15.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.75,1:28:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-给我叫个飞行员。  -是，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get me a pilot.   -Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.68,1:28:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏泰将率领战团。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey will lead the war party.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.48,1:28:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请停下，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop please I
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.27,1:28:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只会让事情更糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This will only make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.52,1:28:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这里没有发言权！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do not speak here!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.23,1:28:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要直击他们的心脏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will strike them in the heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.91,1:28:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏泰！别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey! Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.25,1:28:58.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你！  -听我说，兄弟……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You!   -Listen. Brother...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.26,1:29:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你和这个女人结合了？  -哦，糟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You mated with this woman?   -Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.68,1:29:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.18,1:29:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们已在艾娃面前结合。已成定局。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are mated before Eywaa. It is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.77,1:29:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兄弟，求你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.98,1:29:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别攻击天空人。否则会有很多奥马提卡亚人死去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not attack the Sky People. Many Omaticaya will die if you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.86,1:29:24.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是我兄弟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are not my brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.36,1:29:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不是你们的敌人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I am not your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.78,1:29:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敌人在外面，而且他们非常强大！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The enemy is out there, and they are very powerful!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.91,1:29:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走！走！走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.92,1:29:43.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我可以跟他们谈。  -不用再谈了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can talk to them.   -No more talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏泰！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.01,1:29:53.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是奥马提卡亚人。我是你们中的一员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am Omaticaya. I am one of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.76,1:29:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有权说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I have the right to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.52,1:30:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有话要说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have something to Say...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.82,1:30:07.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……对你们所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tO all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.32,1:30:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些话像石头压在我心里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The words are like stones in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.79,1:30:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官，对不起。不，不，不！等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, I'm sorry. No, no, no! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.79,1:30:22.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能中断进行中的链接！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't interrupt a link in progress!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.21,1:30:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这非常危险！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.59,1:30:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.01,1:30:33.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等！  -别起来，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait!   -Stay down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.51,1:30:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。听我说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.85,1:30:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我被派到这里是为了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was sent here to...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.77,1:30:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.36,1:30:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是个披着假躯壳的恶魔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lt is a demon ina false body.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.71,1:31:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你他妈疯了吗？  -你越界了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you out of your goddamn mind?   -You crossed the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.55,1:31:15.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这具肉体推出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wheel this meat out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake! What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.23,1:31:25.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我失望了，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You let me down, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.02,1:31:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，怎么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.78,1:31:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你找了个本地妞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you find yourself some local tail
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.86,1:31:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就彻底忘了自己在为哪边效力？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you just completely forget what team you're playing for?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.12,1:31:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帕克，还有时间挽回局面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parker, there is time to salvage the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.74,1:31:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-帕克……  -闭上你的嘴！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Parker...   -Shut your pie hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.33,1:31:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然呢，巡逻兵？你要开枪打我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or what, Ranger Rick? You gonna shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.58,1:31:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我可以。  -你该管好你的狗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I could do that.   -You need to muzzle your dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.42,1:31:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们能不能都冷静一点？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, can we just take this down a couple of notches, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.26,1:31:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说想让你的手下活着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You say you want to keep your people alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.84,1:31:54.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就先听她说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You start by listening to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.93,1:31:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些树对奥马提卡亚人是神圣的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those trees were sacred to the Omaticaya
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.30,1:31:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-以你无法想象的方式。  -你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-iNn a way you can't imagine.   -You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.18,1:32:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿随便扔根棍子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You throw a stick in the air around here,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.56,1:32:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都会砸到某种神圣的蕨类，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's gonna land on some sacred fern,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.60,1:32:06.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-老天啊！  -我说的不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-for Christ's sake!   -I'm not talking
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么异教巫术。我说的是真实存在的东西，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about some kind of pagan voodoo here. I'm talking about something real,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.57,1:32:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能在森林生物学里测量出来的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something measurable in the biology of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.28,1:32:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到底是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.82,1:32:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们目前所知道的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What we think we know
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.24,1:32:20.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是树根之间存在某种电化学交流\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is that there is some kind of electrochemical communication
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.70,1:32:25.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像神经元之间的突触。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}between the roots of the trees, like the synapses between neurons.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.16,1:32:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每棵树与周围树木有一万条连接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And each tree has ten-to-the-fourth connections to the trees around it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.84,1:32:33.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而潘多拉上有一万亿棵树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there are ten-to-the-twelfth trees on Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.92,1:32:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜，那是很多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is a lot, I'm guessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.26,1:32:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连接数比人脑还多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's more connections than the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.80,1:32:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？这是一个网络。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get it? It's a network.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.43,1:32:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个全球网络，纳威人能接入它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a global network, and the Na'vi can access it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.52,1:32:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们能上传和下载数据。记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They can upload and download data. Memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.10,1:32:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在你刚摧毁的那种地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At sites like the one you just destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.44,1:32:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.69,1:32:58.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们在外面到底抽了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell have you people been smoking out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.49,1:33:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们就是他妈的树！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're just goddamn trees!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.33,1:33:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你该醒醒了，帕克。  -不，你才该醒醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You need to wake up, Parker.   -No. You need to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.12,1:33:10.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个世界的财富不在地下。就在我们周围。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The wealth of this world isn't in the ground. It's all around us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.67,1:33:14.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}纳威人知道，他们在为保卫它而战。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Na'vi know that, and they are fighting to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.51,1:33:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想和他们共享这个世界，就得了解他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want to share this world with them, you need to understand them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.84,1:33:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得说我们很了解他们，多亏了杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd say we understand them just fine, thanks to Jake here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.31,1:33:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，博士，过来看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Doc, come take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.85,1:33:30.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不会放弃家园。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not gonna give up their home.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.86,1:33:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不会做交易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not gonna make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.57,1:33:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}换什么？淡啤酒？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For what? Lite beer?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.49,1:33:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有蓝牛仔裤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And blue jeans?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.24,1:33:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们没有任何他们想要的东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing that we have that they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.04,1:33:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们派我来做的一切都是浪费时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything they sent me out here to do is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.05,1:33:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们永远不会离开家园树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're never gonna leave Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.34,1:34:05.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然谈不成，事情就简单了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, since a deal can't be made, I guess things get real simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.56,1:34:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，谢谢。我都感动了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake, thanks. I'm getting all emotional.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.10,1:34:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我差点要给你一个湿吻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I might just give you a big wet kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.74,1:34:23.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会把原住民的伤亡降到最低。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do it with minimal casualties to the indigenous.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.99,1:34:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我先用催泪瓦斯把他们赶出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll drive them out with gas first.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.74,1:34:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是人道做法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll be humane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.92,1:34:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差不多吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.08,1:34:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，动手吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.59,1:34:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-大家快点。  -天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, people.   -Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.59,1:34:43.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收拾东西，走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's pack it up, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.39,1:34:45.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情就是这么办的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.27,1:34:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当人们占着你想的东西不放，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When people are sitting on shit that you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.60,1:34:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就把他们变成敌人。这样你抢起来就名正言顺了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you make them your enemy. Then you're justified in taking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.77,1:34:59.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夸里奇要出动炮艇了。他要去打家园树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quaritch is rolling the gunships. He's gonna hit Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.32,1:35:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.62,1:35:10.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-奥古斯汀博士！你不能上来！  -退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Dr. Augustine! You cannot be up here!   -Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.91,1:35:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帕克。等等。住手。这些人是你要……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Parker. Wait. Stop. These are people you're about to...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.71,1:35:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，不不不不。  -我说了退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. No, no, no, no.   -I said back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.88,1:35:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不过是住在树上的野蛮人！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're fly-bitten savages that live in a tree!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.38,1:35:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吗？你看看周围！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? Look around!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.13,1:35:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你怎么想，但我看到处都是树！他们可以搬走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know about you, but I see a lot of trees! They can move!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.97,1:35:26.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你们能不能就……  -是，长官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can you guys just please...   -Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.47,1:35:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面有家庭。有孩子。还有婴儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are families in there. There are children. Babies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.10,1:35:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要杀孩子吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you gonna kill children?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.48,1:35:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会想让这种血沾在手上。相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want that kind of blood on your hands. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.48,1:35:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我去劝他们搬走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just let me try to talk them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.65,1:35:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.44,1:35:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快速校准。我们马上进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calibrate fast. We're going in, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.95,1:35:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正在校准三号和四号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calibrating three and four.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.95,1:35:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-启动序列。  -开始。三十秒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Run sequence.   -Initiating. Thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.29,1:35:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说。你只有一个小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen to me. You've got one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.08,1:35:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你想让你女朋友也在里面，等斧头落下来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless you want your girlfriend in there when the ax comes down,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.75,1:36:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就让他们撤离。一个小时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you get them to evacuate. One hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.26,1:36:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}父亲！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.76,1:36:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}母亲！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.85,1:36:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}埃图坎，我有话要说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eytukan, I have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.14,1:36:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.52,1:36:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说吧，杰克苏里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Speak, Jakesully.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.36,1:36:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一场大祸降临到我们头上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A great evil is upon US...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.73,1:36:23.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天空人来了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Sky People are coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.86,1:36:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……要摧毁家园树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...tO destroy Hometree.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.82,1:36:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们，他们很快就到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, tell them they're gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.83,1:36:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们必须离开，不然会死的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to leave, or you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.66,1:36:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you certain of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.38,1:36:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们派我来学习你们的方式，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, they sent me here to learn your ways
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.30,1:36:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是为了有一天我能带来这个消息，让你们相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so one day I could bring this message and that you would believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.10,1:36:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么，杰克？你早就知道会这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you saying, Jake? You knew this would happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.94,1:37:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.52,1:37:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一开始只是命令，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, at first it was just orders,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.44,1:37:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来一切都变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.86,1:37:08.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？我爱上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? I fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.28,1:37:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱上了这片森林，爱上了奥马提卡亚族。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I fell in love with the forest and with the Omaticaya people.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.75,1:37:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也爱上了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.21,1:37:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我信任你。  -爱你。爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I trusted you.   -With you. With you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.08,1:37:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我信任你！  -现在相信我，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I trusted you!   -Trust me now, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.34,1:37:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你永远不会成为我们的一员！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will never be one of The People!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.85,1:37:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不该……  -我们试过阻止他们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I shouldn't have...   -We tried to stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.72,1:37:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奈蒂莉，求你了！求你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neytiri, please! Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.61,1:37:42.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们绑起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bind them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.44,1:37:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Leave now!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.78,1:37:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们得走。他们来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to go. They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.96,1:38:05.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抵达目标时间，一分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time on target, one mike.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.21,1:38:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。我们看到目标了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy. We have a visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.26,1:38:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。保持航向030。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roger that. Stay on heading 030.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.34,1:38:11.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到，030。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roger, 030.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.48,1:38:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-快跑进森林！  -他们来了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Run to the forest!   -They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.15,1:38:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们会毁掉这里。  -奈蒂莉，你现在必须走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-They will destroy this place.   -Neytiri, you must go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.79,1:38:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑进森林！快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run to the forest! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.46,1:38:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跑！快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.88,1:38:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.31,1:39:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！该死的，快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! God damn it, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.23,1:39:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骑上伊卡兰……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the ikran...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.78,1:39:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……从上方攻击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_.attack from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.66,1:39:16.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真他妈是一棵大树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is one big damn tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.38,1:39:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊，好啊。看来外交失败了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well. I'd say diplomacy has failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.55,1:39:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，把这事办了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, people, let's get this done!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.72,1:39:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把所有瓦斯弹都给我打进正门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want every gas round you got right in the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.64,1:39:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。CS.40准备发射。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roger. CS.40's going hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.06,1:39:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-开火。  -开火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fire.   -Firing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.69,1:39:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}命中。射得漂亮，王牌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bingo. Mighty good shooting, ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.66,1:40:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官，他们开火了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, they've opened fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.21,1:40:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开什么玩笑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.47,1:40:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这帮蠢货就是不听劝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These dumb bastards ain't getting the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.10,1:40:22.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，加大火力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's turn up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.85,1:40:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-换燃烧弹！  -换燃烧弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Switch incendiaries!   -Switching incendiaries.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.85,1:40:26.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.27,1:40:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.50,1:40:46.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让所有人撤到森林去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get everyone to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.71,1:40:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蟑螂就是这么驱散的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that's how you scatter the roaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.63,1:40:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奈蒂莉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.56,1:41:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走！他要炸掉支柱！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We gotta move! He's gonna blow the columns!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.65,1:41:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.50,1:41:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-莫阿特！不！  -如果你是我们的一员，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mo'at! No!   -If you are one of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.38,1:41:34.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就帮我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.51,1:41:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有呼号，切换导弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All call signs, switch missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.68,1:41:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我用高爆弹打西侧支柱底部。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me HE's at the base of the west columns.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.02,1:41:50.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.44,1:41:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骑兵分队，切换导弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rider section, switch missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.36,1:41:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一号可以。  -二号就位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-One's good.   -Two's rocks up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.40,1:41:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-三号就位。  -来吧，宝贝，开打！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Three's up.   -Yeah, baby, get some!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.53,1:42:00.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理奥斯卡，炮手待命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie Oscar, Gunrunner standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.86,1:42:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-打下来。  -准许开火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bring it down.   -Cleared hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.33,1:42:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，格蕾丝，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Grace, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.54,1:42:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趴下！低头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Down! Head down!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.72,1:42:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快！趴下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on! Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.72,1:42:26.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-全部命中。  -石弹全部命中目标。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Solid hits.   -Solid rocks on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.77,1:42:27.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw this.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.23,1:42:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！你到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.27,1:42:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可没报名干这种事！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't sign up for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.74,1:42:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重复，连续射击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Repeat. Ripple fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.20,1:43:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.82,1:44:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，退后！退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, get back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.34,1:44:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！快，动起来！快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on, move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.89,1:45:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，各位。今晚第一轮酒我请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good work, people. First round's on me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.23,1:45:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's boogie.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.90,1:45:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}龙式机左转，返航。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dragon coming left, heading home.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.73,1:45:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}枪手左转。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gunrunner coming left.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.73,1:45:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-雷霆收到。  -骑兵小队收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thunder copies.   -Rider section copies.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.91,1:45:33.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}父亲！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.88,1:45:51.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.30,1:45:55.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接过……我的……弓。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}take...my...bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.52,1:46:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保护族人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Protect The People.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.41,1:46:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奈蒂莉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.67,1:46:27.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对不起。对不起。  -滚开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.   -Get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.09,1:46:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.47,1:46:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出这里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.64,1:46:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永远别回来！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.95,1:46:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切断连接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.03,1:46:57.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，你们不能这样！  -你们不能这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, you can't do that!   -You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.74,1:46:59.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-冷静！冷静！  -不！求你们了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Calm down! Calm down!   -No! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.89,1:47:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾是个战士，梦想着能带来和平。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was a warrior who dreamed he could bring peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.85,1:47:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是，人总有一天得醒来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sooner or later, though, you always have to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.56,1:47:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.87,1:47:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put him down!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.87,1:47:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个杀人凶手！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.25,1:48:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了，兄弟？好久不见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's going on, brother? Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.42,1:48:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.84,1:48:37.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我觉得这些抱树的叛徒不配吃牛排。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Personally, I don't feel these tree-hugging traitors deserve steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.59,1:48:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们有牛排？扯淡。让我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They get steak? That's bullshit. Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.02,1:48:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，你知道那是什么。咽下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. You know what that is. Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.60,1:48:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-楚迪！  -全咽下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Trudy!   -All the way down.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.57,1:48:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马克斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Max!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.83,1:49:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}楚迪，发动飞机！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trudy, fire up the ship! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.96,1:49:06.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.14,1:49:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-安全。快。  -给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Clear. Come on.   -Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.15,1:49:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马克斯，你留在这。我需要里面有个信得过的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Max, stay here. I need someone on the inside I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.12,1:49:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。快走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.17,1:49:56.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安全。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.34,1:49:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.64,1:50:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校？长官？我这儿有情况。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel? Sir? I got a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.02,1:50:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是萨姆森1-6。未经许可启动引擎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Samson 1-6. Unauthorized engine start.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.15,1:50:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.24,1:50:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.45,1:50:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戴上面罩！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mask on!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.37,1:50:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毒气，毒气，毒气！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gas, gas, gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.83,1:50:28.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人朝我开枪！快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking fire! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.33,1:50:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住我的手！快，进来了。走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grab my hand! Come on, we're in. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.42,1:50:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，走！走，走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, let's go! Let's go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.89,1:50:51.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上校！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.98,1:51:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太好了！太好了！  -好！太棒了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah! Yeah!   -All right! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.74,1:51:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-该死。  -后面的人都还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Crap.   -Everybody all right back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.45,1:51:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太棒了，宝贝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.04,1:51:10.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-诺姆，你没事吧？  -没事！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Norm, you good?   -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.79,1:51:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会毁了我一整天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is gonna ruin my whole day.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.42,1:51:16.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-格蕾丝中弹了！  -什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Grace is hit!   -What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.34,1:51:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-拿急救包。  -急救包！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get the trauma kit.   -Trauma kit!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.01,1:51:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-按住，格蕾丝。  -急救包在前面，舱壁上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep the pressure on, Grace.   -Trauma kit's forward, on the bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.59,1:51:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-撑住，格蕾丝。  -没关系。没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hang on, Grace.   -Doesn't matter. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.43,1:51:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-可以了。  -起飞！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're good to go.   -Take it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.06,1:51:35.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓紧。我来拉杆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. I'm pulling pitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.28,1:51:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以走了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.66,1:51:52.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直往北飞。带我们进深山。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just keep going north. Get us deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.50,1:51:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.92,1:52:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-诺姆，你那边还好吗？  -嗯！还活着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Norm, you all good up there?   -Yep! Still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.09,1:52:10.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少在这儿他们追踪不到我们。深入旋涡这么远。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, at least they can't track us up here. Not this far into the Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.81,1:52:12.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}灵魂之树那里最强，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's strongest at the Tree of Souls, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.98,1:52:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.52,1:52:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。因为我们就去那儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good. 'Cause that's where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.32,1:52:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.91,1:52:31.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个娇气包。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You big baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.66,1:52:34.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们出发了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.66,1:52:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会找人来救你，格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna get you some help, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.67,1:52:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是科学家，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a scientist, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.80,1:52:43.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不信童话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't believe in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.05,1:52:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}族人能救你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The People can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.47,1:52:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.72,1:52:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们为什么要帮我们？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would they help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.66,1:53:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}族人说艾娃会赐予。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The People say Eywa will provide.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.70,1:53:15.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有家，没有希望，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With no home, no hope,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.46,1:53:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们只有一个地方可去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there was only one place they could go.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.06,1:53:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连接已启动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Link's running.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.93,1:53:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-杰克，你有什么计划？  -没有计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's the plan here, Jake?   -There's no plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.02,1:53:43.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏泰现在是族长了。他不会让你靠近那地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey is Olo'eyktan now. He's not gonna let you near that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.65,1:53:46.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须试试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.78,1:53:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始连接。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Launching.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.60,1:54:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弃民。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Outcast.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.60,1:54:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叛徒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Betrayer.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.93,1:54:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}异类。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.64,1:54:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去了眼睛看不见的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was in the place the eye does not see.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.57,1:54:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要他们的帮助，他们也需要我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I needed their help, and they needed mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.33,1:54:39.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但要再面对他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But to ever face them again,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.41,1:54:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得把这事提升到全新的层次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was gonna have to take it to a whole new level.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.47,1:54:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候你的一生就归结为一个疯狂的举动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes your whole life boils down to one insane move.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.56,1:54:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得去做一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something we gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.98,1:55:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会喜欢的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.74,1:55:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}按我的想法，魅影是天空中最凶的猛兽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way I had it figured, Toruk is the baddest cat in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.62,1:55:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有东西敢攻击它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing attacks him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.78,1:55:18.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稳住，伙计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.54,1:55:20.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那它怎么会往上看呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So why would he ever look up?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.50,1:55:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过这只是个推测。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But that was just a theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.86,1:56:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魅影骑士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Toruk Macto?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.28,1:57:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.87,1:57:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.46,1:57:31.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我曾经害怕，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was afraid, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.63,1:57:34.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为我的族人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.13,1:57:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在不怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.23,1:57:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏泰，阿特尤之子……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey, son of Ateyo...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.19,1:57:53.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我站在你面前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I stand before you...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.19,1:57:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……准备为奥马提卡亚族效力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...ready to serve the Omaticaya people.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.99,1:58:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是族长，你是伟大的战士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are Olo'eyktan, and you are a great warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.41,1:58:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有你，我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.63,1:58:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魅影骑士，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Toruk Macto,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.85,1:58:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我愿与你同飞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will fly with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.94,1:58:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的朋友快死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My friend is dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.02,1:58:34.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝快死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace is dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.57,1:58:38.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我恳求艾娃的帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I beg the help of Eywa.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.37,1:58:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们在哪儿，格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look where we are, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.05,1:59:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得取些样本。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to take some samples.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.91,1:59:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伟大的母亲也许会选择把她的一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Great Mother may choose to save all that she is
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.20,1:59:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都留在这具身体里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in this body.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.21,1:59:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可能吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.92,1:59:40.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她必须穿过艾娃之眼才能回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She must pass through the eye of Eywa and return.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.72,1:59:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是，杰克苏利，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, Jakesully,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.26,1:59:45.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她太虚弱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she is very weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.35,1:59:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坚持住，格蕾丝。他们会治好你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on, Grace. They're gonna fix you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.40,1:59:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请听我们说，圣母。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hear us please, All Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.56,1:59:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾娃，帮帮她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cywa, help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.57,2:00:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这个灵魂接纳于你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take this spirit into you...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.32,2:00:07.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……再把她呼吸回我们身边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}...and breathe her back to us.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.37,2:00:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让她行走在我们中间……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let her walk among us...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.50,2:00:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}……成为族人的一员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}_..as one of The People.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.36,2:00:47.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.91,2:00:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.16,2:00:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和她在一起，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm with her, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.92,2:00:58.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真的存在！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's reall!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.34,2:01:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝？格蕾丝，求你了。格蕾丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace? Grace, please. Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.68,2:01:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.26,2:01:09.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.22,2:01:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.14,2:01:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}格蕾丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.36,2:01:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.28,2:01:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成功了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.37,2:01:38.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的伤太重了，时间不够。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her wounds were too great. It was not enough time.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.08,2:01:41.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她现在和艾娃在一起了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is with Eywa now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.62,2:02:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}若你允许，我现在要说几句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With your permission, I will speak now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.71,2:02:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请你替我翻译，我会很荣幸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You would honor me by translating.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.26,2:02:32.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天空人给我们送来一个讯息\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Sky People have sent us a message
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.85,2:02:38.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们想要什么就能拿走什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that they can take whatever they want
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.06,2:02:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人能阻止他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and no one can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.44,2:02:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们就给他们回一个讯息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we will send them a message.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.82,2:02:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们骑上坐骑，像风一样飞奔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ride out as fast as the wind can carry you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.45,2:02:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉其他部族前来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You tell the other clans to come.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.96,2:03:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉他们，魅影骑士召唤他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You tell them Toruk Macto calls to them.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.67,2:03:08.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，跟我一起飞！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you fly now with me!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.51,2:03:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的兄弟姐妹们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My brothers! Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.14,2:03:15.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要让天空人看看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we will show the Sky People
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.22,2:03:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不能想拿什么就拿什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that they cannot take whatever they want,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.60,2:03:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that this,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.77,2:03:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是我们的土地！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this is our land!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.90,2:03:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.46,2:03:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.24,2:04:18.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.18,2:04:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们驰向四方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We rode out to the four winds.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.39,2:04:42.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前往平原的马族。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To the horse clans of the plain.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.81,2:04:46.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回应星辰的召唤！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back to the stars!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.90,2:04:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前往东海之滨的伊卡兰部族。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To the ikran people of the Eastern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.19,2:04:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了我们子孙的子孙！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For our children's children!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.57,2:04:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}魅影骑士一召唤，他们就来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When Toruk Macto called them, they came.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.95,2:04:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yah!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.53,2:05:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个基地上的每个人，你们每一个人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone on this base, every one of you,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.11,2:05:38.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都在为生存而战。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is fighting for survival.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.99,2:05:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是事实！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a fact!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.37,2:05:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面有一群土著正在集结，准备进攻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's an aboriginal horde out there massing for an attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.20,2:05:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些轨道图像告诉我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, these orbital images tell me
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.46,2:05:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敌军的数量已经从几百人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that the hostiles' numbers have gone from a few hundred
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.76,2:05:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一天之内涨到了两千多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to well over 2,000 in one day.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.88,2:05:58.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且还有更多人在涌来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And more are pouring in.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.30,2:06:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一周之内，他们可能有两万人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a week's time, there could be 20,000 of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.81,2:06:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到那时，他们就会突破我们的防线。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At that point, they will overrun our perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.23,2:06:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那绝不可能发生！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.02,2:06:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们唯一的安全就是先发制人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our only security lies in pre-emptive attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.73,2:06:17.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要以恐怖对抗恐怖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will fight terror with terror.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.45,2:06:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敌人相信他们这座山中的堡垒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, the hostiles believe that this mountain stronghold of theirs
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.66,2:06:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}受他们的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is protected by their...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.12,2:06:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的神保护。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their deity.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.83,2:06:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等我们把它摧毁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when we destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.96,2:06:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要在他们的民族记忆里炸出一个深坑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we will blast a crater in their racial memory so deep
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.38,2:06:39.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他们再也不敢靠近这里一千公里之内。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that they won't come within 1,000 klicks of this place ever again.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.01,2:06:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也一样是事实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that, too, is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.39,2:06:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.65,2:06:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，这里疯了。全面动员。他们正在把穿梭机改装成轰炸机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake, it's crazy here. It's full mobilization. They're rigging the shuttle as a bomber.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.69,2:07:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们弄来了几大板矿用炸药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They've got these huge pallets of mine explosives.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.03,2:07:04.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是要搞什么震慑行动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's for some kind of shock-and-awe campaign.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.03,2:07:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的雏菊切刀！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fricking daisy cutters!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.45,2:07:10.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}夸里奇接管了。他已经动手了，没人拦得住他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quaritch has taken over. He's rolling, and there's no stopping him.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.37,2:07:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么时候？  -明天早上六点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-When?   -0600 tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.54,2:07:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-马克斯！马克斯！  -我得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Max! Max!   -/ gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.25,2:07:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们完蛋了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.22,2:07:21.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还指望能有个战术计划\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I was hoping for some sort of tactical plan
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.51,2:07:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用去送死的那种。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that didn't involve martyrdom.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.22,2:07:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要用弓箭对付武装直升机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're going up against gunships with bows and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.56,2:07:33.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有十五个部落在外头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have 15 clans out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.31,2:07:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两千多名战士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's over 2,000 warriors.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.90,2:07:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们熟悉这些山。我们会飞，你也会飞。他们不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we know these mountains. We fly them. You fly them. They don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.41,2:07:47.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们的仪器在这上面不管用。导弹追踪也不管用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Their instruments won't work up here. Missile tracking won't work.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.95,2:07:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们只能直线瞄准射击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll have to fire a line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.58,2:07:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他们来这里打，我们就有主场优势。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they bring the fight to us, then we have the home-field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.71,2:07:59.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道他会直接把那架轰炸机派去灵魂之树。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know he's gonna commit that bomber straight to the Tree of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.26,2:08:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I Know.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.51,2:08:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果他们到了灵魂之树，就完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If they get to the Tree of Souls, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.09,2:08:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是他们与艾娃、与祖先的直接联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's their direct line to Eywa, their ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.10,2:08:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会毁了他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.18,2:08:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我想我们最好阻止他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then I guess we'd better stop him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.70,2:08:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在大概只是在跟一棵树说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm probably just talking to a tree right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.12,2:08:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你在听，我得提醒你一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you're there, I need to give you a heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.42,2:08:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果格蕾丝和你在一起，就看看她的记忆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If Grace is with you, look into her memories.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.09,2:08:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看我们来自的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See the world we come from.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.30,2:08:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里没有绿色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no green there.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.60,2:08:53.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们杀死了自己的母亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They killed their Mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.35,2:08:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们也要在这里做同样的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they're gonna do the same here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.48,2:09:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会有更多天空人来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More Sky People are gonna come.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.15,2:09:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会像永不停歇的雨一样到来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're gonna come like a rain that never ends.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.49,2:09:07.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非我们阻止他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless we stop them.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.82,2:09:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你选中我是有原因的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, you chose me for something.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.37,2:09:16.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会站出来战斗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.33,2:09:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.42,2:09:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我需要一点帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I need a little help here.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.80,2:09:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的大地母亲不偏袒任何一方，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our Great Mother does not take sides, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.64,2:09:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只守护生命的平衡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She protects only the balance of life.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.86,2:09:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}值得一试。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.27,2:10:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！对！这才像话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Yeah! That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.36,2:10:27.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！对！这才像话，伙计！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Yeah! That's what I'm talking about, man!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.79,2:10:43.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是领队。我们正在进入涡流区。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Group Leader. We are entering the Flux Vortex.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.59,2:10:47.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-切换到手动飞行模式。  -收到。手动飞行模式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Switch to manual flight mode.   -Copy. Manual flight mode.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.08,2:11:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里是龙爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Papa Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.00,2:11:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次任务我要干净利落。我要赶回家吃晚饭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want this mission high and tight. I want to be home for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.64,2:11:38.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-机甲小队，上。  -好了，姑娘们，让他们尝尝苦头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Suit Team, go.   -All right, ladies, let's bring the pain!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.94,2:11:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快，快，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.16,2:11:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉沃1-1，向左移动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bravo 1-1, move left.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.49,2:12:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉沃1-1向左移动。注意侧翼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bravo 1-1 moving left. Watch flank.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.29,2:12:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-保持队形。继续前进。  -收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Watch formation. Keep moving.   -Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.92,2:12:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理2-1，注意间距。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie 2-1, watch your spacing.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.38,2:12:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。完毕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.80,2:12:16.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抬头盯着。检查上方。留意热成像扫描。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eyes up. Check that overhead. And watch those thermal scans.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.10,2:12:20.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有单位，龙爸领队，向目标推进。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All call signs, Papa has lead, pushing to target.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.47,2:12:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}护航机，紧跟着我的穿梭机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Escorts, stay close on my shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.02,2:12:30.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在这儿得掉点漆了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are gonna lose some paint in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.53,2:12:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}炮手们，脑袋放灵活点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gun crews, keep your head on a swivel.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.24,2:12:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别搞错了，各位，他们就在外面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make no mistake, people, they're out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.74,2:12:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，看到目标了。距离四公里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, people, target in sight. Range, four klicks.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.08,2:12:44.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女武神1-6，把载荷准备好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Valkyrie 1-6, get your payload ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.46,2:12:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-收到。准备投放。  -军士长，把武器架好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Copy. Prepare to offload.   -Staff Sergeant, stage the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.71,2:12:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把它推到舱门！快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roll it to the ramp! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.21,2:12:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.26,2:13:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}查理2-1，发现大量移动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charlie 2-1, got big movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.39,2:13:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-保持位置。  -等等，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hold position.   -Hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:04.89,2:13:09.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-外面有动静，五百米。  -查理2-1，保持位置。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We got movement out there, 500 meters.   -Charlie 2-1, hold position.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.20,2:13:18.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官，地面有动静！正在快速接近。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, ground has movement! Fast approaching.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.20,2:13:20.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-查理奥斯卡，骑兵分队。  -射击线！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Charlie Oscar, Rider section.   -Firing line!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.16,2:13:23.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目标逼近。距离四百米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Targets closing. Range, 400 meters.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.58,2:13:27.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你不能把画面清干净吗？  -不行，长官。是涡流。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Can't you clean it up?   -No, sir. It's the Flux.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.61,2:13:58.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}兄弟，我来打开缺口。你跟着我冲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brother, I'm gonna punch a hole. You follow me through.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.99,2:14:42.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有飞机，自由开火！自由开火！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All aircraft, weapons free! Weapons free!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.87,2:14:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}右转脱离。绕回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Break right. Come around.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.66,2:14:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我打！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Light them up!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.80,2:15:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}散开队形，攻击所有敌人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Break formation, engage all hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.22,2:15:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！干掉他们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! Get some!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.14,2:15:49.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝎式机，追击并摧毁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scorpions, pursue and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.78,2:16:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！杰克！听到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake! Jake! You copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.24,2:16:06.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在撤退！我们被打惨了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're falling back! We're getting hammered!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.08,2:16:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。撤出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy. Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.16,2:16:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他。追上去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's him. Get after him!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.52,2:16:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干掉他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.28,2:16:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我打！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Light her up!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.79,2:16:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那儿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.29,2:16:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有枪的不止你一个，贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not the only one with a gun, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.79,2:16:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把她锁定在视野里。  -排放中。补充泄漏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep her in your sights.   -Purging. Feeding the leak.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.54,2:16:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有弹舱准备。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Arming all pods.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.30,2:17:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.08,2:17:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塞兹！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seze!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.14,2:18:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}侠盗一号中弹了。我要冲进去了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rogue One is hit. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.23,2:18:44.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.45,2:18:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开火。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.64,2:19:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}楚泰！兄弟，听到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tsu'tey! Brother, do you read?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.98,2:19:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}侠盗一号，听到吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rogue One, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.64,2:19:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}楚迪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trudy!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.74,2:19:35.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}距目标两分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to target, two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.33,2:19:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女武神1-6，已获准，可以投放。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Valkyrie 1-6, you are cleared and hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.83,2:19:40.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到，龙号。开始投弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy, Dragon. We are starting our bomb run.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.84,2:19:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一号准备！  -一号已准备！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Arm number one!   -Number one armed!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.09,2:19:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.26,2:19:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I read you.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.52,2:20:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-奈蒂莉！  -塞兹死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Neytiri!   -Seze's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.15,2:20:09.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们很近了。他们人很多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They are very close. They are many.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.03,2:20:12.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要攻击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.16,2:20:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能听到吗，奈蒂莉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you read me, Neytiri?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.66,2:20:18.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要攻击！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not attack!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.33,2:20:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上撤退。快离开那儿！这是命令！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall back now. Get out of there! That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.55,2:20:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奈蒂莉！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neytiri!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.84,2:20:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有动静，有动静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got movement, I got movement.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.84,2:20:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原地待命。有东西过来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold position. Something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.18,2:20:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉沃1-1，我这儿有个大信号。把画面切过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bravo 1-1, I got a big seating. Turn screens over.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.06,2:20:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-两百米外有动静。  -保持队形。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We got movement 200 meters.   -Hold your formation.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.31,2:20:44.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-做好准备。  -注意两翼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Be ready.   -Watch your flanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.19,2:20:50.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一百米，正快速逼近。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hundred meters and closing fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.21,2:21:09.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得撤了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.71,2:21:12.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-撤退！撤退！  -快走！快走！快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fall back! Fall back!   -Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.55,2:21:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退！快跑！快跑！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall back! On the run! On the run!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.06,2:21:24.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克，艾娃听到了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake, Eywa has heard you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:31.65,2:21:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾娃听到了你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eywa has heard you!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.00,2:21:45.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.68,2:21:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}撤退！快走！快走！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fall back! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.04,2:22:26.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官！所有护航机都被击落或撤退了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir! All escorts are down or falling back.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.75,2:22:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这事了结掉。女武神1-6，我是龙号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get this done. Valkyrie 1-6, this is Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.96,2:22:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-向目标逼近。  -收到。向目标逼近。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Press to target.   -Copy. Pressing to target.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.88,2:22:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备投弹，30秒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stand by to drop, 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:55.73,2:22:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我口令。二，一，投！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On my mark. Two, one, mark.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.24,2:23:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}投！投！投！快，快，快，快！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Drop! Drop! Drop! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.69,2:23:35.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓稳！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brace!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.87,2:23:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是苏利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's Sully.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.97,2:24:10.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-戴上面罩！  -失压警报！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mask on!   -Breach alarm!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.42,2:26:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。到爸爸这儿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.75,2:27:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}投降吧，夸里奇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Give it up, Quaritch!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.58,2:27:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.38,2:27:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我还有一口气，就没结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing's over while I'm breathing.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.92,2:27:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就盼着你这么说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I kind of hoped you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.31,2:28:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.46,2:28:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，苏利，背叛自己种族的感觉怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Sully, how's it feel to betray your own race?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.17,2:28:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你是他们的一员？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you're one of them?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.63,2:28:56.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该醒来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.45,2:30:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.25,2:30:56.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:14.32,2:31:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.79,2:31:33.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰克！我的杰克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jake! Ma Jake!
Dialogue: 0,2:32:15.42,2:32:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:22.42,2:32:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I See you.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:35.36,2:32:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外星人回到了他们垂死的世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The aliens went back to their dying world.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.36,2:32:43.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有少数人被选中留下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only a few were chosen to Stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:55.42,2:32:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大悲痛的时代结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The time of great sorrow was ending.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.05,2:33:02.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}托鲁克·马克托不再被需要了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Toruk Macto was no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:14.98,2:33:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，这大概是我最后一次视频日志了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I guess this is my last video log.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.73,2:33:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为不管今晚发生什么，不管怎样，我都……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause whatever happens tonight, either way, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.57,2:33:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不会再回到这个地方了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna be coming back to this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.99,2:33:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我该走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I guess I'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:36.71,2:33:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我自己的派对可不能迟到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I don't want to be late for my own party.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.13,2:33:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，毕竟今天是我生日。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it's my birthday, after all.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:48.09,2:33:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是杰克·苏利，通话结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is Jake Sully signing off.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.94,2:41:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}英语 - 美国\N{\rEN\blur0.8}English - US
